    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d564">

                <pb facs="0616" n="566" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg566"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Baker to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-06-16"><hi rendition="#small-caps">June</hi> 16,
                        1894</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The provisional Government of Salvador informs me that the President of the
                    United States has recognized that Government, and now ask extradition refugees.
                    Is it so? What shall I do?</p>
            </div>
        </body>
